  m_Name: S09_Hazard_Unsecured_Racking
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: "Identify Hazard 4 \u2014 Unsecured Racking"
  <Description>k__BackingField: On Aisle A you will see a section of racking with
    a missing upright guard at the base. Racking guards protect the structural uprights
    from forklift impact. Without them, a single collision can cause a progressive
    racking collapse that brings down an entire aisle. Racking inspections should
    be carried out weekly by a designated person, and any damaged or missing component
    must be tagged out and reported before the aisle is used. Log this hazard to
    complete the hazard walk.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12f5e3847eeb022488e0e73441b03139, type: 3}
  <HasChallenges>k__BackingField: 1
  <IsInOrder>k__BackingField: 1
  TutorialChallengeLists:
  - <ChallengeTitle>k__BackingField: Log the Unsecured Racking
    <ChallengeTriggerName>k__BackingField: TRIGGER_Safety_LogRacking
    <IsComplete>k__BackingField: 0
